The bundled `hand_landmarker.task` is the official MediaPipe Hand Landmarker float16/1 model
bundle, downloaded from the public MediaPipe model endpoint and verified by SHA-256 during every
build. The upstream task page and model card are the authoritative references for the model:

- https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/hand_landmarker
- https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-assets/Model%20Card%20Hand%20Tracking%20(Lite_Full)%20with%20Fairness%20Oct%202021.pdf
- https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/hand_landmarker/hand_landmarker/float16/1/hand_landmarker.task

The model card identifies its documentation as Apache 2.0, but does not state a separate license
for the binary model bundle. This project therefore makes no broader license claim for that file;
review the current upstream terms before commercial redistribution or a modified model bundle.

MediaPipe source: https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe
